Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 06:18:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: preserve conflicting videos before final save

Prepare canonical destinations only after a staged video is ready. Keep a verified recovery copy outside indexed downloads before removing the original file. Record the download worker stop reason before foreground cleanup.
